WEBVTT

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:02.880
We are lying to both. We are lying to both lightweight

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:07.400
pilots and heavier pilots. Current standard is testing the

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:12.560
perfect vertical drop and there are loads of problems with this

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:14.920
